- [Data extraction](https://www.scrapingbee.com/llms/data-extraction.txt) — Tags: CSS selectors, XPath, `extract_rules`, AI extraction, `ai_query`, `ai_extract_rules`, structured JSON.
- [JavaScript scenarios](https://www.scrapingbee.com/llms/js-scenario.txt) — Tags: browser interaction, click, fill, wait, scroll, infinite scroll, `js_scenario`.
- [Proxy mode](https://www.scrapingbee.com/llms/proxy-mode.txt) — Tags: proxy-mode, HTTP proxy, HTTPS proxy, SOCKS5, external proxy client, proxy credentials.
- [Premium proxy country codes](https://www.scrapingbee.com/llms/country-codes-premium.txt) — Tags: premium proxy, geotargeting, residential proxy, `country_code`, ISO 3166-1.
- [Classic proxy country codes](https://www.scrapingbee.com/llms/country-codes-classic.txt) — Tags: classic proxy, geotargeting, `country_code`, US fallback.

